    "title": "San Lorenzo Deputies Pull Two Kids From Bandoni Avenue House Blaze - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Eileen Vargas ,\n12 hours ago Two Alameda County sheriff’s deputies rushed into a burning home in the 1600 block of Bandoni Avenue in San Lorenzo yesterday, pulling out a 12-year-old and a 14-year-old, according to county officials. The agency publicly released the location of the fire but did not immediately share the youths’ conditions or say what started the blaze. Read full article",
